  "instructions": [
    "Preheat air fryer to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a bowl, mix together peanut butter, soy sauce, maple syrup, grated ginger, and lime juice.",
    "Add sliced chicken and mix until well coated.",
    "Thread chicken onto iron teppan or skewers, followed by a hazelnut and a sprinkle of nutmeg.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Air fry for 10 minutes, or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with green onions and additional hazelnuts if desired."
  ],
